{title: 319 - Lord, I Want to Be a Christian}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #319 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 319}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Lord, I [Gm]want to [Bb]be [Gm]a [Fm]Christian [Eb/G]in my heart, [Gm]in [Ab]my [Gm]heart,
[Cm/G]Lord, I [Eb/Bb]want to be a [Fm/Ab]Christian [Ab]in my [Cm/G]heart.
[Ab]In my [Eb/G]heart, in my [Ab]heart,
[Ab/Eb]Lord, I want to be [Cm]a Christian [Gm]in my [Cm]heart.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Lord, I [Gm]want to [Bb]be [Gm]more [Fm]loving [Eb/G]in my heart, [Gm]in [Ab]my [Gm]heart,
[Cm/G]Lord, I want [Eb/Bb]to be more loving [Fm/Ab]in [Cm/G]my heart, [Ab]in my [Cm/G]heart.
[Ab]In my [Eb/G]heart, in my [Ab]heart,
[Ab/Eb]Lord, I want to be more [Cm]loving [Ab]in my [Gm]heart, in [Cm]my heart.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]Lord, I [Gm]want to [Bb]be [Gm]more [Fm]holy [Eb/G]in my heart, [Gm]in [Ab]my [Gm]heart,
[Cm/G]Lord, I want [Eb/Bb]to be more holy [Fm/Ab]in [Cm/G]my heart, [Ab]in my [Cm/G]heart.
[Ab]In my [Eb/G]heart, in my [Ab]heart,
[Ab/Eb]Lord, I want to be more [Cm]holy [Ab]in my [Gm]heart, in [Cm]my heart.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Eb]Lord, I [Gm]want to [Bb]be [Gm]more [Fm]like [Eb]Jesus in my [Gm]heart, [Ab]in [Gm]my heart,
[Cm/G]Lord, I want [Eb/Bb]to be more like Jesus [Fm/Ab]in [Cm/G]my [Ab]heart, in my [Cm/G]heart.
[Ab]In my [Eb/G]heart, in my [Ab]heart,
[Ab/Eb]Lord, I want to be more like [Cm]Jesus [Ab]in my [Gm]heart, in [Cm]my heart.
{end_of_verse}
